+// BunkerVR: a plank held by a VR hand gives as far as the hand pulls it from
+// where it took hold: not at all for the first gfVRTearSlack (meters), then
+// all of its give once pulled gfVRTearReach further (see VRTearByHand).
+const float gfVRTearSlack = 0.03f;
+const float gfVRTearReach = 0.12f;
+// ...the health of a plank torn by its health alone goes this many times as
+// fast as by the game's own pull, so that it comes off in one firm pull,
+// before the hand is pulled off it...
+const float gfVRTearHealthMul = 2.5f;
+// ...and at its full give, with a hand this far off the spot it holds,
+// pulling on, it comes off anyway (meters)...
+const float gfVRTearYankPast = 0.15f;
+// ...and taken up again within this long of a hand's hold on it ending (the
+// other hand keeping it, or a hand slipping off), its health carries over
+// (seconds).
+const float gfVRTearTakenAgainWithin = 1.0f;
+
