+		// BunkerVR: held by a VR hand, the hand's pull sets the tear's speed
+		// (VRTearByHand), not the mouse or the sticks; nor is the view turned to
+		// keep the plank on the screen (CheckOutsideAtScreenEdgeAndMove), which in
+		// the headset would turn the world around the player.
